  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "By the time he arrived at the station, the train ____.（考查过去完成时）", "options": ["A. has left", "B. had left", "C. left", "D. was leaving"], "answer": "B", "analysis": "By the time + 一般过去时从句，主句动作先于到达发生，用过去完成时 had left，表示过去的过去。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "Look at the clouds! It ____ soon.（考查将来时表达）", "options": ["A. rains", "B. is going to rain", "C. will be raining", "D. rained"], "answer": "B", "analysis": "be going to 表示根据现有迹象（乌云）预测即将发生。will 多表临时决定或客观将来；此处有明显迹象，用 be going to 最佳。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "The novel ____ well since it was published last year.（考查现在完成时与语态）", "options": ["A. sells", "B. is sold", "C. has sold", "D. has been sold"], "answer": "C", "analysis": "sell well 销路好，用主动形式表被动含义（write/read/wash 等类动词）；since 从句提示主句用现在完成时，故选 has sold。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "This time tomorrow we ____ over the Pacific Ocean.（考查将来进行时）", "options": ["A. fly", "B. will fly", "C. will be flying", "D. are flying"], "answer": "C", "analysis": "This time tomorrow 表示明天此时正在进行的动作，用将来进行时 will be doing。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "The letter ____ in French; I cannot read it at all.（考查语态与时态）", "options": ["A. writes", "B. wrote", "C. is written", "D. has written"], "answer": "C", "analysis": "信是被写，用被动语态 is written。write 作不及物表被动仅限 write well 类，此处无 well 修饰，须用被动。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "—You are too late. The meeting ____.—Oh, sorry.（考查现在完成时被动）", "options": ["A. has begun", "B. has been on", "C. has ended", "D. had ended"], "answer": "C", "analysis": "由你迟到了推断会议已经结束，对现在有影响，用现在完成时 has ended。end 为短暂动词，不用完成时加一段时间。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "用所给动词的正确时态填空：She ____ (work) in this company for ten years by next month.", "options": [], "answer": "will have worked", "analysis": "by next month 表示到将来某时为止，用将来完成时 will have done。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "用所给动词的正确形式填空：The bridge ____ (build) two years ago and now it is in use.", "options": [], "answer": "was built", "analysis": "two years ago 表过去，桥是被建，用一般过去时被动 was built。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "用所给动词的正确时态填空：I ____ (read) the novel the whole morning, and I still haven't finished it.", "options": [], "answer": "have been reading", "analysis": "the whole morning 与至今未完成，强调动作持续且仍在进行，用现在完成进行时 have been doing。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "When the mother got home, her baby ____. So she walked in quietly.（考查过去进行时）", "options": ["A. sleeps", "B. slept", "C. was sleeping", "D. has slept"], "answer": "C", "analysis": "妈妈到家时婴儿正在睡觉，过去某一时刻正在进行，用过去进行时 was sleeping。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "Great changes ____ in my hometown in the past few years.（考查现在完成时）", "options": ["A. took place", "B. have taken place", "C. were taken place", "D. have been taken place"], "answer": "B", "analysis": "in the past few years 与现在完成时连用；take place 无被动，故选 have taken place。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "用所给动词的正确形式填空：The problem ____ (discuss) at tomorrow's meeting is very important.", "options": [], "answer": "to be discussed", "analysis": "tomorrow's meeting 提示被动且将来，用不定式被动式 to be discussed 作后置定语，修饰 problem。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "—Did you telephone the manager's office?—Yes, he ____ back before tomorrow noon.（考查将来时）", "options": ["A. expects", "B. is expected", "C. expected", "D. will expect"], "answer": "B", "analysis": "he is expected back 意为预计他会回来，用一般现在时被动表安排好的预期，expect sb back 的被动结构。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "用所给动词的正确形式填空：The road is covered with snow; it ____ (must, snow) last night.", "options": [], "answer": "must have snowed", "analysis": "对过去事情的肯定推测用 must have done，此处 must have snowed 表示昨晚一定下雪了。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "The shop ____ at 8 a.m. and ____ for twelve hours every day.（考查主动表状态）", "options": ["A. opens; is open", "B. is opened; opens", "C. opens; opens", "D. is open; opens"], "answer": "A", "analysis": "open 作动词表开门（动作），一般现在时 opens；be open 表开着的状态，与 for twelve hours 连用。"},
