  {"qtype": "解答题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "【应用文·申请信】请用英语写一句申请信的自我推荐句，包含对岗位/志愿者活动的兴趣和自身优势（30词左右）。", "options": [], "answer": "I am quite interested in the volunteer program and, as a fluent English speaker with rich experience, I believe I am well qualified for it.", "analysis": "申请信要表明兴趣(I am interested in)并列举优势(fluent English, experience)，最后用 be qualified for 收束，体现说服力。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "【应用文·道歉信】补全道歉句：I am terribly sorry for being absent from your party, and I want to ____ for it.（填动词，意为道歉）", "options": [], "answer": "apologize", "analysis": "apologize for sth 为某事道歉，apologize to sb 向某人道歉。注意与 make an apology 的词性区别。"},
