  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【应用文·结尾】补全书信结尾套语：Looking forward to ____ from you soon.（填动词-ing，意为收到来信）", "options": [], "answer": "hearing", "analysis": "hear from sb 收到某人来信；look forward to 中 to 为介词，后接动名词 hearing。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【应用文·邀请信】表达「我写信邀请你参加……」最地道、得体的一句是？", "options": ["A. I write letter ask you come.", "B. I am writing to invite you to take part in...", "C. I want you must come.", "D. Invite you, come please."], "answer": "B", "analysis": "I am writing to invite you to... 是邀请信标准开头句式，take part in 表示参加（活动），故选 B。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【应用文·建议信】补全：I strongly ____ that you (should) make a reasonable study plan first.（填动词，意为建议）", "options": [], "answer": "suggest", "analysis": "suggest that sb (should) do sth 建议某人做某事，从句用 should 加动词原形的虚拟语气，should 可省略。"},
