  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【应用文·申请信】补全：I believe I am the right person for the ____ you advertised.（填名词，意为职位、岗位）", "options": [], "answer": "position", "analysis": "position 指职位、岗位；the right person for the position 即该职位的合适人选。"},
