  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·可朗读】听下面对话：W: I'd like to book a single room for two nights. M: Ok, may I have your name? 问题：Where does the conversation probably take place?", "options": ["A. In a hotel.", "B. In a hospital.", "C. In a library.", "D. In a shop."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "book a single room for two nights 订单人间两晚是酒店场景，关键词 book/room 提示地点为 hotel。可朗读对话后作答。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·可朗读】听：W: The flight CA1234 takes off at 9:30. M: We'd better arrive at the airport by 8:00. 问题：What are they talking about?", "options": ["A. A train ticket.", "B. Air travel time.", "C. A weather report.", "D. A hotel booking."], "answer": "B", "analysis": "flight/take off/arrive at the airport 均与航班和时间安排相关，谈论的是乘机时间安排。可朗读。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·应答语】—How are you getting along with your new classmates? 恰当应答是？", "options": ["A. Quite well, thanks.", "B. No problem.", "C. I'm fine, and you?", "D. It doesn't matter."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "问句问与同学相处如何，应回答相处得不错 quite well 并致谢。C 是回答身体好；B/D 答非所问。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "【听力·数字】听：W: The shirt is 80 dollars. M: Can you give me a discount? I'll take two. 问题：How much will the man pay if he gets 20% off each?", "options": ["A. 80 dollars.", "B. 128 dollars.", "C. 160 dollars.", "D. 64 dollars."], "answer": "B", "analysis": "每件80美元，八折后每件64美元，买两件共128美元。听力数字题须边听边记。可朗读。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·场景词汇】在餐厅场景中，顾客想看菜单会说 Could I have the m____, please?（填一个词）", "options": [], "answer": "menu", "analysis": "menu 菜单，餐厅高频词。听力中 menu/order/bill/dessert 常一起出现。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·可朗读】听：M: Sorry I'm late. The bus was held up in the heavy rain. W: That's all right. Come in. 问题：Why was the man late?", "options": ["A. He got up late.", "B. The bus was delayed by rain.", "C. He missed the bus.", "D. His bike broke down."], "answer": "B", "analysis": "held up 意为延误，原因是大雨，对应公交车因雨延误。注意 held up 的同义替换。可朗读。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·场景词汇】在机场办理登机时，工作人员会要求出示 p____ and boarding pass.（填一个词，护照）", "options": [], "answer": "passport", "analysis": "passport 护照，与 boarding pass 登机牌同为机场高频词。注意拼写。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "【听力·态度】听：W: Another rainy day! I planned to go hiking. M: Cheer up. We can play board games at home. 问题：What is the woman's feeling?", "options": ["A. Delighted.", "B. Disappointed.", "C. Excited.", "D. Confused."], "answer": "B", "analysis": "Another rainy day! I planned to go hiking 表达计划被打乱的失望，disappointed。cheer up 反证其情绪低落。可朗读。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·可朗读】听下面对话：M: I'd like to return this book, and I'm afraid it's overdue. W: Please pay the fine at the counter first. 问题：Where does the conversation probably take place?", "options": ["A. In a library.", "B. In a restaurant.", "C. In a garage.", "D. In a bakery."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "关键词 return this book（还书）、overdue（逾期）、fine（罚款）、counter（柜台）都指向图书馆，故选 A。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·数字时间】听：W: The film starts at 7:30. M: Take it easy, we still have 40 minutes to go. 问题：What time is it now?", "options": ["A. 6:50.", "B. 7:10.", "C. 7:50.", "D. 6:40."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "电影 7:30 开始，还剩 40 分钟，7:30 往前推 40 分钟为 6:50，故选 A。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·人物关系】听：W: Could you explain the homework once more, sir? M: Sure, come to my office after class. 问题：What is the probable relationship between the speakers?", "options": ["A. Teacher and student.", "B. Husband and wife.", "C. Doctor and patient.", "D. Shop assistant and customer."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "homework（作业）、sir、after class、office 表明双方是师生关系，故选 A。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·应答语】—Would you mind opening the window? It's a bit hot here. 表示不介意、同意开窗，恰当应答是？", "options": ["A. Of course not.", "B. Yes, please.", "C. You're welcome.", "D. Never mind."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "Would you mind... 请求许可，表示不介意用 Of course not / Not at all；回答 Yes 表示介意，与语境相反，故选 A。"},
  {"qtype": "填空题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·场景词汇】在酒店办理退房结账时，顾客常说 Could I have the b____, please?（填一个词，意为账单）", "options": [], "answer": "bill", "analysis": "账单为 bill；have/pay the bill 结账、买单。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 3, "stem": "【听力·数字】听：M: How much are the tickets? W: 30 yuan each, but students pay half price. M: We are two students. 问题：How much will the two students pay in all?", "options": ["A. 30 yuan.", "B. 15 yuan.", "C. 60 yuan.", "D. 45 yuan."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "学生半价为每张 15 元，两名学生共 15×2=30 元，故选 A。"},
  {"qtype": "选择题", "difficulty": 2, "stem": "【听力·意图】听：W: Would you like some more coffee? M: Just a little, please. 问题：What does the man mean?", "options": ["A. He wants a little coffee.", "B. He dislikes coffee.", "C. He prefers tea.", "D. He wants no more coffee."], "answer": "A", "analysis": "Just a little, please 表示只要一点点咖啡，是肯定但量少，故选 A。"},
